  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.5.0:\n      - Adds optional AstraFlow.Mapper.Conventions for opt-in convention mapping.\n      - Adds mapping profiles, exact pair registration, include/ignore rules, sensitive-field blocking, strict validation, and deterministic mapping plan export.\n      - Extends diagnostics with mapping plan output so convention-created members are reviewable.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
